# Secure Boot signing keys. Only DER public certificates belong in-tree
# (meta-rpi5-uefi/recipes-bsp/edk2/files/secureboot-keys); the PK private
# key lives outside this work tree entirely -- see that directory's README.
*.key
*.pem
secureboot-pk/
